      ],
      "scenario": null,
      "action_sequence": "Open Edit on Production. Submit a blank name, a one-space name, and ports 65536, abc, and 0. Submit again with a blank name and port 0. Capture 120\u00d740, then 80\u00d724, then restore 120\u00d740. After the reopen shots, set the port to 65535 and submit.",
      "expected_results": "The blank and whitespace names draw Required. The invalid ports draw Port must\u2026 at 120\u00d740 and Port mus\u2026 at 80\u00d724, with status Fix the highlighted fields. The saved record shows name Production, host prod-db-1.acme.io, port 65535, engine PostgreSQL, environment production, and Safe Mode.",
